[2026-10-23T01:19:29.442Z] Error: Command failed: node /Users/aruna/coding-memory/coding-memory/dist/cli.js save coding-memory decision fix: hook chaining silently no-op'd when cm ran through a symlinked bin

main() was gated behind an isMainModule check (added for test safety)
comparing process.argv[1] against import.meta.url. That check never
matched when invoked through the global `cm` bin, which is a symlink —
argv[1] keeps the symlink path as invoked while import.meta.url resolves
to the real target. main() silently never ran, so cm init did nothing at
all (not just skipping hook chaining — the chaining logic was never
reached in the first place). Fixed by resolving argv[1] through
realpathSync before comparing.

